.TH VIBECODER-ADMIN 1 "2026-10-31" "vibecoder 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vibecoder-admin \- administer a local vibecoder installation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibecoder-admin
.RI [ --config " FILE" ]
.RI [ --json ]
.RI { status | doctor | config | projects | accounts | credentials | agents | service | setup }
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provides validated administration without direct JSON or SQLite editing. Mutating
operations require root. Secrets are accepted from an un-echoed TTY or an already
open file descriptor and are never accepted as command arguments.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/vibecoder/supervisor.json
Validated supervisor configuration.
.TP
.I /etc/vibecoder/accounts.json
Non-secret Codex account runtime configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/vibecoder/secrets
Protected credential store.
.SH SECURITY
The service user is not an administrator. Local credential revocation does not revoke
the corresponding token at its remote provider.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vibecoder-supervisor (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
